         "note": "stamped, and preceded by the heavy fixed mark of the slug, which I have not counted as a figure: the figures alone give a possible date, so the mark is the same blob reading.md warns about. Every figure is plain in both panels. e4 carries a separate four-figure number in ink, 5553 or 6553, with the tops of the figures along the crop edge; e1 is torn, e2 and e5 hold nothing but the leader tab and the colour target"
